Package: libexo-2-0
Version: @DEB_EXO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/exo/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0
Description: Helper/extension library for Xfce applications
 exo provides extension widgets and helper APIs used by Thunar, the panel and
 other Xfce applications (preferred-application/MIME helpers, toolbar editor,
 icon view, etc.). Ships libexo-2 and the exo-* utilities.
